    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d262-a1">

                <pb facs="0571" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg565"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 11.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dole to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Government Building</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1893-01-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 17,
                    1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">John L.
                        Stevens</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States Minister
                        Resident:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I acknowledge the receipt of your valued
                    communication of this day, recognizing the Hawaiian Provisional Government, and
                    express deep appreciation of the same.</p>
                <p>We have conferred with the ministers of the late government and have made demand
                    upon the marshal to surrender the station house. We are not actually yet in
                    possession of the station house, but as night is approaching and our forces may
                    be insufficient to maintain order, we request the immediate support of the
                    United States forces, and would request that the commander of the United States
                    forces take command of our military forces so that they may act together for the
                    protection of the city.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sanford B. Dole</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chairman Executive Council</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(Note of Mr. Stevens at the end of the above communication: “The above
                        request not complied with.—Stevens.”)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
